# tccompare must also compare the length of both strings
Out write: (['secret'] tccompare: ['']), stop.
Out write: ([''] tccompare: ['secret']), stop.
Out write: (['secret'] tccompare: ['sec']), stop.
Out write: (['sec'] tccompare: ['secret']), stop.
Out write: (['secret'] tccompare: ['secret']), stop.
Out write: ([''] tccompare: ['']), stop.
